        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Hidden exorbitant fees exist on airline tickets.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Hidden exorbitant fees occur in food delivery services.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Almost every transaction today includes hidden fees.",
