      },
      {
        "text": "The proposed legislation requires all fees to be fully disclosed upfront.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "If a fee is charged, it should be included in the base price rather than being a concealed extra.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "text": "Consumers have a right to full transparency in pricing before making purchases.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Surprise fees are unethical because they mislead consumers.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Legislation can effectively mandate transparent pricing practices.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "People generally do not expect additional fees beyond the advertised price.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Disclosing fees upfront will lead to more informed consumer decisions.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The current system of hidden fees reflects systemic unfairness in commercial transactions.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The public supports laws that prevent deceptive pricing tactics.",
