        "text": "Consumers expect transparency in pricing and may react negatively to hidden or surprise fees.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "A higher base price that includes fees is perceived as more honest than a lower base price with added fees.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Pricing strategies should aim to simplify consumer decision-making by consolidating costs.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
